    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>むぅぅぅ…………ッ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grrr...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>コ、&lt;Kohaku&gt;……
なんか怒ってる!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, &lt;Kohaku&gt;... what's she grumblin' about?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14972</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;がなんか怒ってる……
・理由を聞いてみる
・触らぬ&lt;Kohaku&gt;にタタリなし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Kohaku seems pissed...
・Ask about it
・You don't wanna mess with an angry &lt;Kohaku&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;……
何怒ってるんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;... what's botherin' you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わたしのマイミソが減ってるの……
お兄ちゃん……知らない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My miso stash is running low... you wouldn't happen to know why... would you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うぐっ!?　わ、わりぃ……
小腹がすいたんで、キュウリに
付けて食っちまったんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O-Oh?! S-sorry &lt;Kohaku&gt;, I was real hungry so I maaay have eaten some along with a cucumber...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16312</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わたしの大切なミソを
勝手に食べちゃうなんてひどい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...How could you touch my precious miso WITHOUT asking me first!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐぎゃッ！
す、すまん、&lt;Kohaku&gt;〜〜〜！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>GAAH! I-I'm sorry &lt;Kohaku&gt;~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>痛つつ……久しぶりに
&lt;Kohaku&gt;に怒られちまったな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Damn that smarts... but, it's been ages since she last had a go at me like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もうすぐだ……
もうすぐ元のお前に戻るんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It won't be long now... then you'll be back to your old self.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19796</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>触らぬ&lt;Kohaku&gt;に
タタリなし……だぜ。
ここは離れよう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You don't wanna mess with an angry &lt;Kohaku&gt;... I'll just... leave her be.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……知らないうちに
わたしのマイミソが減ってる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...My miso keeps disappearing so quickly...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……一体、誰が食べちゃったの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Who would dare eat it all?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
